stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> idle
    idle --> connecting: 创建 Session / 发送消息
    connecting --> streaming: SSE 连接建立
    streaming --> idle: 事件流结束
    streaming --> retrying: SSE 断连
    retrying --> streaming: 重连成功
    retrying --> error: 超过重试阈值
    error --> connecting: 手动重连
